      "en": "“But go now to my place which was in Shiloh, where I caused my name to dwell at the first, and see what I did to it for the wickedness of my people Israel.",
      "ko": "너희는 내가 처음으로 내 이름을 둔 처소 실로에 가서 내 백성 이스라엘의 악을 인하여 내가 어떻게 행한 것을 보라",
      "source_text_hash": "4b5a12e5792f670e69ed1c1c9773c5da2ba487188eb64802394256d4675cfa12",
      "translation_text_hash": "b92e4f5cf53ff76b94fdef5e57dedec7bcb15dde6599883212fe12805d4668e9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
