      ],
      "en": "Cut off your hair, and throw it away, and take up a lamentation on the bare heights; for the LORD has rejected and forsaken the generation of his wrath.",
      "ko": "예루살렘아 너의 머리털을 베어 버리고 자산 위에서 호곡할찌어다 여호와께서 그 노하신바 이 세대를 끊어버리셨음이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "cd06b041167dedad3a195754754286ffb7b17befeef33ee4d64306634b67fbc2",
      "translation_text_hash": "5b6c4c02d6c873d21cfa98a120e6ec9fbc40f56014e72c599b440d0077dcb142",
